+<section class="playground" id="playground" aria-label="Component transition playground"><div class="stage-wrap"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="label"><svg><use href="#layers"/></svg>Component preview</span><span class="badge">SCOPED TRANSITION</span></div><div class="stage"><div class="scope-tag"><span>↳</span> &lt;CoffeeCard /&gt;</div><article class="coffee-card" id="coffee-card"><div class="coffee-image" id="coffee-image"><img id="drink-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461023058943-07fcbe16d735?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Iced latte in a glass on a warm café table"><div class="image-shade"></div><span class="coffee-brand">THE DAILY GRIND</span><button class="favorite" aria-label="Save favorite coffee" aria-pressed="false">♡</button></div><div class="product-body"><div class="product-top"><h2 id="drink-name">Iced oat latte</h2><span class="price" id="drink-price">$5.50</span></div><p class="product-description" id="drink-description">A little pick-me-up. A whole lot of smooth.</p><div class="product-bottom"><div class="drink-switch" aria-label="Choose your coffee"><button class="active" data-drink="iced" aria-pressed="true">Iced</button><button data-drink="hot" aria-pressed="false">Hot</button></div><button class="add-btn" id="add-order">Add to order <span>+</span></button></div></div></article></div><div class="stage-footer"><span><span class="live-dot"></span><span id="transition-status" aria-live="polite">Ready to transition</span></span><span>scope: coffee-card</span></div></div><aside class="controls"><div class="panel-heading"><svg style="width:14px;height:14px" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h16M4 17h16"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="3" fill="#fdfefb"/><circle cx="16" cy="17" r="3" fill="#fdfefb"/></svg>Transition settings</div><div class="controls-body"><div class="duration-control"><label class="control-title" for="duration">Duration <output id="duration-value">650 ms</output></label><input id="duration" type="range" min="200" max="1500" step="50" value="650"><div class="range-labels"><span>200 ms</span><span>1500 ms</span></div></div><div class="easing-control"><label class="field-label" for="easing">Easing</label><select id="easing"><option value="cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)">Ease out cubic</option><option value="ease-in-out">Ease in out</option><option value="linear">Linear</option><option value="cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)">Spring</option></select></div><hr><div class="boundary-control"><div class="toggle-row"><span id="boundary-label">Show scope boundary</span><button class="toggle" id="boundary" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="boundary-label"></button></div><p class="control-hint">See exactly where the transition begins and ends.</p></div><div class="replay-wrap"><button class="replay" id="replay"><svg><use href="#refresh"/></svg>Replay transition</button><p class="tip">Try switching between Iced and Hot</p></div></div></aside></section>
